.venv
__pycache__
*.pdf
# The working store stays local: eo.db holds every run and every raw model
# response, and data/raw/ is a re-fetchable cache. The two published artefacts
# are the analysis database and the flat-file export -- both derived from public
# Federal Register data, both rebuildable with `eo analysis-db` / `eo export`.
data/*
!data/analysis.db
!data/export/
.env
my_secrets.py
.DS_Store
